ential test**: a `dlopen` driver exercises all 5 entry points — `init_config_from_env` against 4 pre-seeded bit patterns (including all-ones, to catch padding-bit handling), `parse_env_numeric` over 7 names, `perform_operation`/`apply_bit_operations` across **all 256** flag byte patterns × 16 edge-case values (incl. `INT_MIN`/`INT_MAX`), and `envy` over a 32×32 grid of boundary params.\n- Run under 14 environment configurations (verbose/debug/optimize on/off, comma and semicolon warning paths, junk and overflowing numerics, empty values). **All 14 pass with stdout and stderr byte-identical** (~425KB–820KB of output per case), plus 2 merged-stream cases.\n\n`c_src/` was not modified."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":448,"cache_read_input_tokens":42485,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":448,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bd4b277a-ed45-41b2-aebc-5c851a92e82b","uuid":"115fb621-77a2-4694-99a0-24e555e433aa","timestamp":"2026-08-19T16:18:20.439Z"}
